@startuml 01-upload-document
title POST /api/documents - synchroniczna część (upload + zapis + event)

actor Client as C
participant "RequestIdFilter" as RIF
participant "TenantContextFilter" as TCF
participant "DocumentController" as Ctrl
participant "DocumentUploadValidator" as V
participant "DocumentService" as DS
participant "StoreFileUseCase" as SF
participant "DocumentRepository" as DR
participant "ApplicationEventPublisher" as AEP
database "PostgreSQL" as DB

C -> RIF: POST /api/documents\n(multipart: file=plik.pdf)
activate RIF
note over RIF #LightBlue: Generuje albo czyta\nX-Request-Id, wstawia\ndo MDC

RIF -> TCF: chain.doFilter()
activate TCF
note over TCF #LightBlue: Resolver wybiera tenant\n(mock w dev → DEFAULT_TENANT)\nUstawia w TenantContext + MDC

TCF -> Ctrl: uploadDocument(file)
activate Ctrl

Ctrl -> V: validate(filename, mimeType)
note over V #LightYellow: Whitelist:\n.pdf .docx .txt .md\nOdrzuca .exe etc → 400

Ctrl -> DS: upload(UploadDocumentCommand)
activate DS

DS -> SF: store(StoreFileCommand)
SF -> DB: INSERT stored_files
note over SF #LightBlue: Plik zapisany\n(local storage albo S3)\nzwraca StoredFileId

DS -> DR: save(Document)\n(status=PENDING)
DR -> DB: INSERT documents

DS -> AEP: publishEvent(DocumentUploadedEvent)
note over AEP #LightBlue: Modulith outbox:\nzapisuje event do tabeli\nevent_publication\nw TEJ SAMEJ transakcji

AEP -> DB: INSERT event_publication
note over DB: COMMIT — wszystko\nlub nic (atomicity)

DS --> Ctrl: Document (z UUID v7)
deactivate DS

Ctrl --> TCF: 202 Accepted\nLocation: /api/documents/{id}
deactivate Ctrl

TCF --> RIF: response
deactivate TCF
note over TCF #LightBlue: finally:\nTenantContext.clear()\nMDC.remove(tenantId)

RIF --> C: HTTP 202\n+ X-Request-Id header
deactivate RIF

note over C #LightYellow: Klient dostaje status=PENDING.\nIndeksowanie idzie w tle\n(patrz 02-indexing-pipeline)

@enduml
